      "text": "The LLT is deﬁned by Eq.(14), where m is taken to be the mass of the particle species under consideration. This is an inﬁnitesimal LLT since λab = −λba. The LLT then turns out to have only four nonvanishing terms which can be separated in to two symmetries,",
