      "text": "This turns out to also be a boost along the 1-axis and a rotation about the 2-axis, as in Schwarzschild black hole case. With constant momentum pa (x) = (mcosh(ζ),0,0,msinh(ζ)) pointing in the 3-axis, the change of the spin becomes a rotation as follows.",
